      "dc:source": "australian-heritage-commission-short-title-amendment-act-1976.pdf, p.1",
      "values:originalText": "Section 3 of the Principal Act is amended—\ninterpret­\nation.\n(a) by inserting in sub-section (1), before the definition of\n“Australia”, the following definition: —\n“ ‘Aboriginals’ means persons who are—\n(a) members of the Aboriginal race of Australia; or\n(b) members of the race to which Torres Strait\nIslanders belong; ”; and\n(b) by omitting from sub-section (1) the definition of “ representa­\ntive Commissioner” and substituting the following definition:—\n“ ‘representative Commissioner’ means a Commissioner\nwhose appointment is authorized by sub-section\n12 (1 A );” .\n4.\nSection 7 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting paragraph Functions of\n(a) and substituting the following paragraph:—\nCommission.\n“ (a) to furnish advice to the Minister, either of its own motion or\nupon request made to it by the Minister, on matters relating to\nthe national estate, including advice relating to action to con­\nserve, improve and present the national estate; ”.\n\nNo. 135\nAustralian Heritage Commission Amendment\nConsultation\nCommission.",
      "skos:definition": "Section 3 of the Principal Act is amended—\ninterpret­\nation.\n(a) by inserting in sub-section (1), before the definition of\n“Australia”, the following definition: —\n“ ‘Aboriginals’ means persons who are—\n(a) members of the Aboriginal race of Australia; or\n(b) members of the race to which Torres Strait\nIslanders belong; ”; and\n(b) by omitting from sub-section (1) the definition of “ representa­\ntive Commissioner” and substituting the following definition:—\n“ ‘representative Commissioner’ means a Commissioner\nwhose appointment is authorized by sub-section\n12 (1 A );” .\n4.\nSection 7 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting paragraph Functions of\n(a) and substituting the following paragraph:—\nCommission.\n“ (a) to furnish advice to the Minister, either of its own motion or\nupon request made to it by the Minister, on matters relating to\nthe national estate, including advice relating to action to con­\nserve, improve and present the national estate; ”.\n\nNo. 135\nAustralian Heritage Commission Amendment\nConsultation\nCommission.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-heritage-commission-short-title-amendment-act-1976-sec-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-heritage-commission-short-title-amendment-act-1976-sec-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b5d70e547975d8a65d02e2e4b70a568665a84948e5104a47eb3429c190a598a0",
      "skos:note": "Definition of Aboriginals inserted into sub-section (1) of Section 3."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-heritage-commission-short-title-amendment-act-1976#sec-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3 Section 3",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 1,
      "values:originalText": "Section 3 of the Principal Act is amended—\ninterpret­\nation.\n(a) by inserting in sub-section (1), before the definition of\n“Australia”, the following definition: —\n“ ‘Aboriginals’ means persons who are—\n(a) members of the Aboriginal race of Australia; or\n(b) members of the race to which Torres Strait\nIslanders belong; ”; and\n(b) by omitting from sub-section (1) the definition of “ representa­\ntive Commissioner” and substituting the following definition:—\n“ ‘representative Commissioner’ means a Commissioner\nwhose appointment is authorized by sub-section\n12 (1 A );” .\n4.\nSection 7 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting paragraph Functions of\n(a) and substituting the following paragraph:—\nCommission.\n“ (a) to furnish advice to the Minister, either of its own motion or\nupon request made to it by the Minister, on matters relating to\nthe national estate, including advice relating to action to con­\nserve, improve and present the national estate; ”.\n\nNo. 135\nAustralian Heritage Commission Amendment\nConsultation\nCommission."
    },
