      },
      "dc:source": "australian-heritage-commission-short-title-amendment-act-1976.pdf, p.2",
      "values:originalText": "Section 8 of the Principal Act is amended—\n(a) by inserting, after the word “ authorities” (first occurring), the\nwords “of the Commonwealth and”; and\n(b) by adding at the end thereof the words “ and, in particular,\nwithout limiting the generality of the foregoing, shall consult\nwith the Director of National Parks and Wildlife in relation to\nany matter that concerns the establishment or management of a\npark or reserve under the National Parks and Wildlife Conser­\nvation Act 1975”.\nMembership",
      "skos:definition": "Section 8 of the Principal Act is amended—\n(a) by inserting, after the word “ authorities” (first occurring), the\nwords “of the Commonwealth and”; and\n(b) by adding at the end thereof the words “ and, in particular,\nwithout limiting the generality of the foregoing, shall consult\nwith the Director of National Parks and Wildlife in relation to\nany matter that concerns the establishment or management of a\npark or reserve under the National Parks and Wildlife Conser­\nvation Act 1975”.\nMembership",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-heritage-commission-short-title-amendment-act-1976-sec-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-heritage-commission-short-title-amendment-act-1976-sec-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "dd85529756dffafcd2bd9882334911b945a63b0e348ca4a535e7da58ebc38e0f",
      "skos:note": "State must consult with Director of National Parks and Wildlife in relation to park or reserve management."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-heritage-commission-short-title-amendment-act-1976#sec-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5 Section 5",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 2,
      "values:originalText": "Section 8 of the Principal Act is amended—\n(a) by inserting, after the word “ authorities” (first occurring), the\nwords “of the Commonwealth and”; and\n(b) by adding at the end thereof the words “ and, in particular,\nwithout limiting the generality of the foregoing, shall consult\nwith the Director of National Parks and Wildlife in relation to\nany matter that concerns the establishment or management of a\npark or reserve under the National Parks and Wildlife Conser­\nvation Act 1975”.\nMembership"
    },
