      },
      "dc:source": "australian-heritage-commission-short-title-amendment-act-1976.pdf, p.3",
      "values:originalText": "Section 32 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting sub- Staff of\nsections (2) and (3) and substituting the following sub-section: —\nCommission.\n“ (2) The use of the services of the Staff of the Commission by Com­\nmissioners is subject to the control of the Chairman. ”.",
      "skos:definition": "Section 32 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting sub- Staff of\nsections (2) and (3) and substituting the following sub-section: —\nCommission.\n“ (2) The use of the services of the Staff of the Commission by Com­\nmissioners is subject to the control of the Chairman. ”.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-heritage-commission-short-title-amendment-act-1976-sec-8-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-heritage-commission-short-title-amendment-act-1976-sec-8-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8a45c5b61a43452bd5d9cac2a2eeaa101a29c89082cef58af9da5837bb084e2e",
      "skos:note": "Commissioners' use of staff services is subject to Chairman's control."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-heritage-commission-short-title-amendment-act-1976#sec-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "8 Section 8",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 3,
      "values:originalText": "Section 32 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting sub- Staff of\nsections (2) and (3) and substituting the following sub-section: —\nCommission.\n“ (2) The use of the services of the Staff of the Commission by Com­\nmissioners is subject to the control of the Chairman. ”."
    },
