      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1 Section 1",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 3,
      "values:originalText": "The following provisions of the Principal Act are amended by omitting the word “Australia”\n(wherever occurring) and substituting the words “the Commonwealth ’ —\nSection 3(1) (definition of “authority of Australia”), 9, 12 (3), (7), (8) and (9), 17 (2), 30, 33\nand 42."
    },
